    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "effective_io_concurrency 的含义已经变过两次",
      "summary": "effective_io_concurrency 控制预取深度，含义随版本改过两次。PostgreSQL 13 之前它要过一个调和级数公式，设成 10 实际只预取三页左右；13 到 17 就是并发 I/O 请求数；18 起它驱动 PostgreSQL 自己的异步 I/O，走 worker 进程或 io_uring，默认值也从 1 改成 16。Christophe Pettus 提醒不要跨大版本照搬旧值，SSD 上可以往几百试但必须实测。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/all-your-gucs-in-a-row-effectiveioconcurrency/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-06-22",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/6f158e7ebc1c4880a93bc650bc8fb9d5.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "参数",
        "IO",
        "预取"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pg_stats 里的四个列决定了规划器怎么估行数",
      "summary": "规划器读的是 pg_statistic，pg_stats 是同一份数据的可读视图，由 ANALYZE 扫表汇总生成，大批量导入后建议手工跑一次。Richard Yen 讲了四个关键列：n_distinct（唯一列为 -1）、null_frac、correlation（物理与逻辑顺序的吻合度）和最常见值列表。直方图默认 100 个等深桶，可用 ALTER TABLE 调大统计目标，多列相关的偏差交给 CREATE STATISTICS。",
      "url": "https://richyen.com/postgres/2026/06/22/pg_stats_how_postgres_internal_stats_work.html",
      "author": "Richard Yen",
      "source": "richyen.com",
      "source_date": "2026-06-22",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "统计信息",
        "优化器",
        "ANALYZE"
      ],
      "position": 3
